E belongs to the series of motherboards with a decent power supply system, cooling, and general quality\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ESTONIA</span> <span>02/16/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-XE GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Excellent equipment\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.iycloud.eu/reviews/ASUS_ROG_Strix_B550-XE_Gaming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001092255220720856.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtesters.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Simply objectively, or in a vacuum, this is very awesome.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>02/23/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-XE GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techtesters.eu/asus-rog-strix-b550-xe-gaming-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/202003101901272060208.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      El Chapuzas Informatico\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      \nThe new B550 chipset means to bury the X570 for most users, since in practice it offers the same features and even higher performance.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>02/01/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-XE GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Gold\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://elchapuzasinformatico.com/2021/02/asus-rog-strix-b550-xe-gaming-wifi-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/201911252353119720633.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Platinum\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Profesional Review\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Platinum</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Asus ROG Strix B550-XE Gaming Wi-Fi has shown in practically all aspects to be at the level of high-end motherboards with X570 chipset\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>12/21/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-XE GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Platinum\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.profesionalreview.com/2020/12/21/asus-rog-strix-b550-xe-gaming-wi-fi-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1352/202101111401597220170.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HARDWARE PLUS\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Wi-Fi 6 support offers ultra-fast wireless network speed, enhanced capacity and better performance on crowded wireless networks, enabling you to experience exceptional online gaming experiences. Cyberpunk-themed design contains eye-catching lines and expressive text. By using your motherboard with other products in the broad ROG ecosystem, you can build a gaming system that reflects your style.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>Türkiye</span> <span>12/31/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-XE GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://hwp.com.tr/rog-srix-b550-xe-gaming-wifi-173817\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202009042311135480930.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice - Bronze\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.diit.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice - Bronze</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      I have slightly mixed feelings from the board. It offers excellent VRM, a very good Realtek S1220A audio codec, 2.5 Gbps ethernet, WiFi 6, plenty of PCIe and SATA ports for ordinary users, a diagnostic POST display and LEDs, and preparation for overclocking. The problem is a rather high price. Otherwise, it's a great board anyway.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>03/31/2021</span></div> <a aria-